    "ElevenLabs voices, Perplexity search, broadcast targets, and live-streaming live under Services. Gateways connect the app to external agents — OpenClaw tool bridges and the Hermes agent bridge. MCP Servers expose external tool servers the AI can call." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
