    "Field Assist, powered by Avenkin, gives service technicians hands-free, domain-grounded guidance. When enabled, the `field_session` tool becomes available and an active session injects the relevant knowledge vault into the AI's context." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
